OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with a few showers
OL,7,Flingering but gradually easing.
OL,8,FOvernight will be mostly dry with some
OL,9,Fclearer spells developing. Not quite
OL,10,Fas cold as the previous night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,13,Fbut with some bright intervals
OL,14,Fbreaking through, the odd afternoon
OL,15,Fshower possible. Outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Fspread east in the evening. Windy at
OL,17,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
