OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fon Sunday with rain, turning wintry
OL,7,Fover the hills, and to lower levels at
OL,8,Ftimes. Showers spreading south Monday,
OL,9,Fwintry over hills. Sunny spells and
OL,10,Flargely dry on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
